<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets bond coupon at 25.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Russia sets bond coupon at 25.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will pay final quarterly interest of 25.52 percent annualised on May 28 on the 18-month OFZ interest-bearing bonds (series 24004)</p>
<p>maturing on May 28, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>coupon number  coupon date  interest rate  interest (rbls)</p>
<p>	   6	    May 28	    25.52	   63,625</p>
<p>	   5	    Feb 26	    40.05	   99,851</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
